Package: HiCocietyExample
Type: Package
Title: Example HiC and Two 'HiCociety' Outputs for Demonstration and
        Testing
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Sora", family = "Yoon", role = c("aut", "cre"),
         email = "sora.yoon@pennmedicine.upenn.edu"))
Maintainer: Sora Yoon <sora.yoon@pennmedicine.upenn.edu>
Description: 
  Provides an example HiC dataset and two examples of 'HiCociety' 
  outputs from a function named hic2community(). 
  The data are intended for demonstration purposes only and kept small 
  enough to be distributed via CRAN.
